IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dsta-staff-and-offences`

-- Defence Science and Technology Agency Act 2000, ss 11, 12, 24(4), 31, 32 and First and Second Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_defence-science-and-technology-agency-act-2000.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 11`

`an engineer told to stay who resigns and leaves early` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS TRUE
    `left before the required period ended` IS TRUE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an engineer told to stay who stays` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS TRUE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an engineer not required to stay who resigns` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS TRUE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an employee who joins a walkout` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS TRUE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an employee who alone refuses a shift` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an employee who urges colleagues to strike` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS TRUE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

`an employee who joins a go-slow` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS TRUE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS FALSE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS TRUE

`a contractor's worker who urges Agency staff to strike` MEANS `Employee conduct` WITH
    `is an employee of the Agency` IS FALSE
    `the Minister required continued employment` IS FALSE
    `left before the required period ended` IS FALSE
    `stopped or refused work in combination with others` IS FALSE
    `incited others to take industrial action` IS TRUE
    `joined a concerted go-slow or work-to-rule` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an engineer told to stay who resigns and leaves early`
#ASSERT NOT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an engineer told to stay who stays`
#ASSERT NOT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an engineer not required to stay who resigns`
#ASSERT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an employee who joins a walkout`
#ASSERT NOT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an employee who alone refuses a shift`
#ASSERT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an employee who urges colleagues to strike`
#ASSERT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `an employee who joins a go-slow`
#ASSERT NOT `the employee commits an offence under section 11` `a contractor's worker who urges Agency staff to strike`

